      "lines": [
        "形。能不能把这两个三角形重新拼成一条边为12厘米",
        "的新的三角形？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "161",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "161. 一个青年工人每小时制成18个零件，8小时完成了定",
        "额。如果他师傅每小时制成24个零件，那么他师傅完",
        "成同样定额需要几小时？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "162",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "162. 从某村到城市有24公里。其中森林地带占全程的$\\frac{3}{8}$，",
        "其余部分为田野。田野占几公里？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "163",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "163. 计算：$20703401-92\\cdot1375-313906$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "12. 小于或大于"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把一片纸带分为7等份（图57）。左面的$\\frac{2}{7}$画上阴影线，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 57",
      "box": [
        600,
        1075,
        416,
        121
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-57"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 57",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图57"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "右面的$\\frac{4}{7}$画上阴影线。左面的阴影部分小于右面的阴影部分。",
        "也就是$\\frac{2}{7}<\\frac{4}{7}$。总之，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "分母相同的两个分数，分子较小的分数就小，分子较大的",
        "分数就大。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "两个不同的数，其中一个数总是小于或大于另一个数。在",
        "射线上小数在大数的左面，而大数在小数的右面（图58）。例",
        "如1在3的左面，因为1比3小。$\\frac{4}{7}$在$\\frac{2}{7}$的右面，因为$\\frac{4}{7}$比",
        "$\\frac{2}{7}$大。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
